{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46197","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十一 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘埃中更有埃尘，时复双眉十爲颦。\n赖有年光飞似箭，是何心地亦称人。\n回贤参孝时时说，蜂虿狼贪日日新。\n天意刚容此徒在，不堪惆怅不堪陈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}